---
source: apps/whether/src/commands/providers.rs
expression: "super::table()"
---
openweather
  auth:         OPENWEATHER_API_KEY
  capabilities: current hourly daily minutely-precip air-quality alerts sun moon geocoding
  limits:       free: 60/min, 1M/month; onecall-4: daily_call_limit, at most 1000 per UTC day
  attribution:  Weather data provided by OpenWeather (CC BY-SA 4.0)
open-meteo
  auth:         none
  capabilities: current hourly daily minutely-precip air-quality sun moon geocoding
  limits:       10,000 calls/day, non-commercial
  attribution:  Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0)
met-norway
  auth:         none; [providers.met-norway] contact goes in the User-Agent
  capabilities: current hourly daily sun
  limits:       honours Expires and If-Modified-Since (terms of service)
  attribution:  Data from MET Norway (CC BY 4.0)
nws
  auth:         none; a User-Agent naming the app
  capabilities: current hourly daily alerts
  limits:       US only; forecasts in providers.order, alerts only as a supplement
  attribution:  Forecast by the NOAA National Weather Service (Public domain (US government work))
pirate-weather
  auth:         PIRATE_WEATHER_API_KEY (sent in a header)
  capabilities: current hourly daily minutely-precip alerts sun moon
  limits:       free: 10000/month; monthly_call_limit defaults to 9000; one call per fetch, refreshed at most every 15 min
  attribution:  Weather data by Pirate Weather (Pirate Weather API terms)
